Our technical architecture will utilize cloud computing, leveraging our expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity. The proposed architecture consists of a containerized application using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) for scalability and high availability, integrating with existing systems through APIs, and incorporating a data engineering layer to ensure seamless data flow between systems.

The solution will provide high availability, with an expected availability of 99.9%, and a response time compatible with daily use by agents, aiming for a time of response below 2 seconds. Our integration capabilities include API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as experience with business software, electronic document management systems, and user directories.

To address the client's environmental objectives, our proposal incorporates sustainable practices and technologies, relying on low-carbon infrastructure and reducing energetic consumption. We will utilize green hosting partners like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy, and implement digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantization to reduce GPU energy consumption.

Our budget proposal is based on a target gross margin of 28% and a minimum acceptable margin of 18%, with a projected margin of around 22-25%. We will allocate resources efficiently, ensuring that the right mix of skilled personnel is allocated to the project, minimizing unnecessary labor costs while maintaining service quality. Our cost optimization strategies include process improvements, renegotiation of subcontractor rates, scope management, and investment in digital tools.

The proposed solution will be deployed in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase on a limited scope followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services. An accompaniment to change and actions of training of the agents will be expected, ensuring a smooth transition to the new solution.

Our consortium is committed to delivering a high-quality solution that meets the client's requirements, while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, level of security, and environmental issues. We believe our proposal offers a robust and innovative solution, with a strong focus on explicability, transparency, and sustainability, and we look forward to the opportunity to discuss our proposal in further detail.
